# The verdict the migration scan must give each disk of this variant (doc 05 §3). The
# builder measures every row on the disks and refuses to build a variant whose
# rows the disks do not show; expected/scan.txt is this file with those facts.
# disk3 is a ZFS member and disk4 and disk5 are the two devices of one btrfs
# filesystem: each is refused by name (Q23); disk1 and disk2 proceed.
disk parity parity
disk disk1 adopt
disk disk2 adopt
disk disk3 refuse zfs
disk disk4 refuse multi-device-btrfs
disk disk5 refuse multi-device-btrfs
disk cache recreated
